Error [E0740]: `protect` uses the effect `IO`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_nonce_effect_bound_precedence.jet:9:16
    |
  9 | fn protect() -[FS]> Int {
    |                ^^
 Why: The signature declares `-[FS]>`, so the body may only use those; `IO` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `IO` to the effect list, or stop using it in `protect`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: protect
